  Description		  "SIH 2026 AI-Assisted Diabetic Retinopathy Screening Workflow Simulation\nMember 6: labdhimehta-2311\nComplete Discrete-Event / Queueing Model: Patient Arrival -> Checkin -> Image Capture -> Network Delay -> AI Inference -> Doctor Review -> Exit"
  ScopeRefreshTime	  0.035000
  OverrideScopeRefreshTime on
